id=ntsync
name=NTSync for AYANEO (KONKR) Pocket FIT (Snapdragon G3 Gen 3)
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=The412Banner
description=Loads the ntsync kernel driver (backported from Linux 6.17) after boot on the Pocket FIT G3 Gen 3 stock Android 14 kernel and exposes /dev/ntsync to apps for Wine/Proton.
